            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>Link clips show the website's logo.</li>
<li>Double-click a link clip to open it in your browser.</li>
<li>Add, rename and delete boards right from the Boards tab.</li>
<li>A red dot on Settings tells you when an update is ready.</li>
<li>Smoother minimizing, and everything fits in small windows.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
